<section class="relative min-h-[55vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16]"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/didtfhfme/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1783745604/ChatGPT_Image_Jul_11_2026_10_22_59_AM_tfswwx.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-30" alt="SEDEX SMETA Ethical Trade Audits"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030a16]/70 via-[#030a16]/40 to-[#030a16]"></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-center py-20"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-eurogold-400/30 bg-eurogold-400/5 mb-6"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400 animate-pulse"></span><span class="heading-font text-[10px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-bold">Supplier Ethical Data Exchange &amp; Members Ethical Trade Audit</span></div><h1 class="heading-font text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-white mb-3 tracking-tight" style="text-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(212,168,67,0.3)">SMETA / Sedex <span class="text-eurogold-400">Ethical Trade Audit Services</span></h1><p class="text-white/90 text-sm md:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">Sedex audit - step by step. Eurocert is an approved SMETA auditing company delivering high-quality Sedex audit reports that are easily understood by buyers and suppliers.</p></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 items-start"><div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-6"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Audit Overview</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">What is <span class="text-euro-600">Sedex?</span></h2></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-slate-700">Sedex (Supplier Ethical Data Exchange)</strong> is a global platform that enables businesses to share and manage ethical data related to their supply chains. It is a <strong class="text-slate-700">non-profit organization</strong> that operates through a secure online database, helping organizations improve ethical and responsible business practices.</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Sedex is widely used by suppliers, manufacturers, and brands to share data on labour standards, improve working conditions, and ensure transparency in supply chains. Sedex uses the <strong class="text-slate-700">Ethical Trade Initiative (ETI) Base Code</strong> as the foundation for its audits.</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed p-4 bg-euro-50/60 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-euro-600 italic">There is no practical difference between Sedex and SMETA from a user&#x27;s perspective - Sedex is the platform, while SMETA is the audit methodology.</p><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-euro-50/40"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-info-circle text-white text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">Important Note</h4></div><ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed"><li>• Sedex is <strong class="text-slate-700">NOT a certification</strong></li><li>• SMETA audits result in an <strong class="text-slate-700">audit report</strong>, not a certificate</li><li>• The <strong class="text-slate-700">Sedex logo cannot be used</strong> on products or marketing materials</li><li>• Only registered members can state their Sedex membership status</li></ul></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-2 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-100 h-[320px] md:h-[400px] group"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367912/eurocert/b2.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" alt="SEDEX SMETA Ethical Trade Audits"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/20 via-transparent to-transparent"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto space-y-8"><div class="p-8 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-clipboard-check text-white text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">What is SMETA Audit?</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3"><strong class="text-slate-700">SMETA (Sedex Members Ethical Trade Audit)</strong> is the audit methodology developed by Sedex members. It provides a standardized approach to evaluate labour conditions, health &amp; safety, environmental practices, and business ethics.</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">SMETA is based on the <strong class="text-slate-700">ETI Base Code</strong>, local laws &amp; regulations, and <strong class="text-slate-700">ILO (International Labour Organization) conventions</strong>.</p></div><div class="p-8 bg-white rounded-2xl border-2 border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5"><span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-euro-600 text-white heading-font text-xs font-bold">SMETA 7.0</span><h4 class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">SMETA Version Upgrade " What&#x27;s New?</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-5"><strong class="text-slate-700">SMETA 7.0</strong> is the latest version of the Sedex audit methodology. This update reflects a significant evolution in ethical auditing practices.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4"><div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-euro-50/40 rounded-xl border border-euro-100"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-users text-white text-xs"></i></div><div><h5 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-1">Stronger Human Rights Focus</h5><p class="text-slate-500 text-xs leading-relaxed">Emphasis on modern slavery, worker welfare, and ethical treatment</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-euro-50/40 rounded-xl border border-euro-100"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-link text-white text-xs"></i></div><div><h5 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-1">Responsible Sourcing</h5><p class="text-slate-500 text-xs leading-relaxed">Better evaluation of ethical sourcing across supply chains</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-euro-50/40 rounded-xl border border-euro-100"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-clipboard-check text-white text-xs"></i></div><div><h5 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-1">Improved Audit Quality</h5><p class="text-slate-500 text-xs leading-relaxed">Enhanced consistency, transparency, and reliability</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-euro-50/40 rounded-xl border border-euro-100"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-file-alt text-white text-xs"></i></div><div><h5 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-1">Updated Reporting &amp; CAPR</h5><p class="text-slate-500 text-xs leading-relaxed">More structured reports and corrective action tracking</p></div></div></div></div><div class="p-8 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-file-alt text-white text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">Previous Version: SMETA 6.1</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">SMETA 6.1 included three main components:</p><ul class="space-y-2"><li class="flex items-center gap-3"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Best Practice Guidance</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-3"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Report Format</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-3"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span class="text-slate-500 text-sm">CAPR Format</span></li></ul><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mt-3">SMETA 7.0 builds on these with improved clarity and stronger compliance checks.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Audit Methodology</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">What Does a Sedex Auditor <span class="text-euro-600">Check?</span></h2><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mt-3 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">SMETA audits are conducted under two options: 2-Pillar and 4-Pillar</p></div><div class="mb-8"><h3 class="heading-font text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xs font-bold">2P</span>SMETA Two-Pillar Audit</h3><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-4"><div class="flex 