our experience with sustainability initiatives and vendor audits.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Audit Scope</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Audit Scope " <span class="text-euro-600">Areas Covered</span></h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-5 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 transition-all duration-300"><span class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-sm group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300">01</span></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900">Labour Standards</h4></div><div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-5 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 transition-all duration-300"><span class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-sm group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300">02</span></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900">Health &amp; Safety</h4></div><div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-5 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 transition-all duration-300"><span class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-sm group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300">03</span></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900">Environment</h4></div><div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-5 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 transition-all duration-300"><span class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-sm group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300">04</span></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900">Business Ethics</h4></div><div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-5 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 transition-all duration-300"><span class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-sm group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300">05</span></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900">Management Systems</h4></div><div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-5 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 transition-all duration-300"><span class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-sm group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300">06</span></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900">Code Implementation</h4></div><div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-5 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 transition-all duration-300"><span class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-sm group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300">07</span></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900">Entitlement to Work</h4></div><div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-5 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 transition-all duration-300"><span class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-sm group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300">08</span></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900">Subcontracting</h4></div><div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-5 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 transition-all duration-300"><span class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-sm group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300">09</span></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900">Home Working</h4></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Reports &amp; Compliance</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">SMETA Audit <span class="text-euro-600">Reports &amp; CAPR</span></h2></div><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8"><div class="space-y-6"><div class="p-6 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-file-alt text-white text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">What Does a SMETA Report Look Like?</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-2">A SMETA report typically exceeds <strong class="text-slate-700">80 pages</strong>, but key areas include:</p><ul class="space-y-2"><li class="flex items-start gap-3"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 text-xs mt-1 shrink-0"></i><span class="text-slate-500 text-sm"><strong class="text-slate-700">Version Number</strong></span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 text-xs mt-1 shrink-0"></i><span class="text-slate-500 text-sm"><strong class="text-slate-700">Audit Team</strong> (APSCA membership check)</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 text-xs mt-1 shrink-0"></i><span class="text-slate-500 text-sm"><strong class="text-slate-700">Audit Findings &amp; Non-conformities</strong></span></li></ul></div><div class="p-6 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-calendar-alt text-white text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">Report Validity</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">There is no official validity period, but generally accepted for <strong class="text-slate-700">1 year</strong>, depending on buyer requirements.</p></div></div><div class="space-y-6"><div class="p-6 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-eye-slash text-white text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">Unable to See SMETA Report?</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">After audit upload, suppliers must <strong class="text-slate-700">publish the report</strong> on the Sedex platform. Without publishing, buyers cannot access it and CAPR tracking cannot begin.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-search text-white text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">Where to Find SMETA Reports?</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Buyers should always access reports directly via the <strong class="text-slate-700">Sedex platform</strong>. Avoid using shared PDFs, as they may be altered.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_right,rgba(212,168,67,0.06)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-18"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">SMETA CAPR</h4><h3 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Root Cause &amp; <span class="text-eurogold-400">Corrective Action</span></h3><p class="text-white/40 text-sm mt-3 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">Every audit identifies non-conformities, which require root cause analysis. A strong focus should be on system-based solutions to prevent recurrence.</p></div><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[1fr,420px] gap-8"><div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-8"><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 text-center"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3"><i class="fas fa-chalkboard-teacher text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-white mb-2">Training Issues</h4><p class="text-white/40 text-xs leading-relaxed">Lack of adequate training for workers or management.</p></div><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 text-center"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3"><i class="fas fa-cogs text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-white mb-2">System Gaps</h4><p class="text-white/40 text-xs leading-relaxed">Placing a system-based solution can prevent recurrence.</p></div><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 text-center"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3"><i class="fas fa-money-bill-wave text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-white mb-2">Cost Constraints</h4><p class="text-white/40 text-xs leading-relaxed">Financial constraints preventing proper implementation.</p></div><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 text-center"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3"><i class="fas fa-user-minus text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-white mb-2">Workforce Shortage</h4><p class="text-white/40 text-xs leading-relaxed">Insufficient workforce to meet compliance requirements.</p></div><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 text-center"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3"><i class="fas fa-question-circle text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-white mb-2">Other Operational Issues</h4><p class="text-white/40 text-xs leading-relaxed">Additional root causes specific to the non-conformity.</p></div></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">Common root causes include training issues, system gaps, cost constraints, workforce shortage, and other operational issues.</p><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">A strong focus should be on <strong class="text-white/70">system-based solutions</strong> to prevent recurrence. A system combines process and communication - placing robust monitoring and reporting can help avoid future non-conformities.</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-col justify-center"><div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(212,168,67,0.1)]"><iframe class="w-full aspect-video" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/XHVNe6bEgD8" title="SMETA Root Cause &amp; Corrective Action" frameBorder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowFullScreen=""></iframe></div><p class="text-white/30 text-xs text-center mt-3 font-medium uppercase tracking-widest">Watch: SMETA CAPR Guide</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8"><div class="p-8 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-list-alt text-white text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">SMETA Audit Checklist</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">The best way to prepare: start with <strong class="text-slate-700">SAQ (Self-Assessment Questionnaire)</strong>, add <strong class="text-slate-700">local legal requirements</strong>, and customize the checklist based on your operations.</p></div><div class="p-8 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-laptop text-white text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">Sedex Advance Platform</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-slate-700">Sedex Advance</strong> is the official platform used to manage profiles, upload audit reports, track corrective actions, and share compliance data.</p></div></div><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto mt-8 p-8 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-address-book text-white text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">Sedex Member Directory</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">Available at an additional cost, the Sedex Member Directory offers:</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-xl border border-slate-100"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-euro-600 text-sm shrink-0"></i><span class="text-slate-600 text-sm font-medium">Global exposure to buyers</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-xl border border-slate-100"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-euro-600 text-sm shrink-0"></i><span class="text-slate-600 text-sm font-medium">Industry benchmarking</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-xl border border-slate-100"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-euro-600 text-sm shrink-0"></i><span class="text-slate-600 text-sm font-medium">Risk scoring</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-xl border border-slate-100"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-euro-600 text-sm shrink-0"></i><span class="text-slate-600 text-sm font-medium">Performance tracking</span></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto grid lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6"><div class="p-6 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-4"><i class="fas fa-user-tie text-white text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-3">How to Become a Sedex Auditor?</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">To become an auditor: must be a member of <strong class="text-slate-700">APSCA (Association of Professional Social Compliance Auditors)</strong>, work with an approved audit firm, and pass required certification exams.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-4"><i class="fas fa-sync-alt text-white text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-3">Membership Renewal</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Sedex membership is <strong class="text-slate-700">annual</strong> and renewed through the Sedex Advance platform.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-4"><i class="fas fa-building text-white text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-3">New Factory Steps</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">1. Register on Sedex platform -  2. Complete SAQ -  3. Pay membership fee -  4. Prepare for audit -  5. Review ETI Code &amp; legal requirements</p></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_right,rgba(212,168,67,0.06)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-18"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Approved Auditing Company</h4><h3 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Why Use <span class="text-eurogold-400">Eurocert</span> for Sedex Audits?</h3></div><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8"><div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">Dedicated Expertise</h4></div><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">Experienced social audit professionals with expertise in both <strong class="text-white/70">2-Pillar &amp; 4-Pillar audits</strong>. Anonymous worker surveys for deeper insights.</p></div><div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-chart-line text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">Supply Chain Excellence</h4></div><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">Strong background in sustainability initiatives. Expertise in vendor &amp; social audits. Custom dashboards and reporting solutions.</p></div></div><div class="p-5 mt-8 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5 text-center"><p class="text-white/60 text-sm leading-relaxed">We are an <span class="text-eurogold-400 font-bold">approved auditing company</span> authorized to conduct Sedex audits, providing <strong class="text-white/70">clear, reliable, and high-quality reports</strong>.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mt-6"><div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5 text-center"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-3xl block mb-1 leading-none">49</span><span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-white/50 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Countries</span></div><div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5 text-center"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-3xl block mb-1 leading-none">25+</span><span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-white/50 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Years Experience</span></div><div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5 text-center"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-3xl block mb-1 leading-none">ACCREDITED</span><span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-white/50 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] heading-font"><a href="/accreditations/" class="hover:text-eurogold-400 transition-colors">Independent Third-Party Audits</a></span></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-8"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Explore More</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Related Certifications</h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-4xl mx-auto"><a class="group relative h-[280px] rounded-2